<title>GERMANY: Thyssen sees clear improvement in H2.</title>
<headline>Thyssen sees clear improvement in H2.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBURG, Germany 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German steel and engineering group Thyssen AG sees a clear improvement in its business situation in the second half of 1996/97, which began on October 1.</p>
<p>According to the text of a speech prepared for delivery at the company's annual general meeting, Chairman Dieter Vogel said an upswing in economic growth as well as the company's own restructuring woul improve the outlook.</p>
</text>
